<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS - WSC - 11-JUN.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS - WSC - 11-JUN.</headline>
<text>
<p>Supertyphoon Nestor is in the northern Mariana Islands. Top winds are 155 mph. Nestor is moving to the northwest and is expected to near Iwo Jima in about 36 hours, with only slight weakening expected between now and then. This system is an extreme danger to the islands and to shipping in the region. Seas of over 20 feet can be expected along the track of the storm, along with extreme winds and torrential rainfall.</p>
</text>
